        "body_raw": "This spell functions as ooze form II except you can also assume the form of a Huge ooze. You gain blindsight 60 feet and a +8 resistance bonus on saving throws against mind-affecting effects and poison as well.\n\nHuge Ooze: If you assume this form, you gain a +4 size bonus to your Strength, a +10 size bonus to your Constitution score, a –10 penalty to your Dexterity score, base speed 20 feet, climb speed 20 feet, swim speed 30 feet, a slam attack (2d6 plus 2d6 acid and grab), and constrict (2d6)."
